### DI-3: Fabricated Financial Metrics

**Root Cause**: [Admin Dashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/src/pages/admin/Dashboard.tsx#L44-L92) computes:
- Payroll estimates from `headcount × hardcoded salary` (₹65k employee, ₹95k TL, ₹125k admin)
